---
import Layout from '@layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = "Beijing Travel Guide: What to See, Eat, and Know";
const description = "Your complete Beijing guide — attractions, transport, food, and where to stay.";
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} lang="zh">
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-12">
    <header class="mb-12">
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-3">🏙️ 北京</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-4 leading-tight">北京旅游指南：看什么、吃什么、知道什么</h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-6">你完整的北京指南——景点、交通、食物和住宿地点。</p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-sm text-gray-500">
        <span>📅 最后更新日期：2026年6月</span>
        <span>⏱️ 阅读8分钟</span>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-red-50 to-orange-50 border-l-4 border-red-500 rounded-r-2xl p-8 mb-12 not-prose">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-red-900 mb-4">⚡ 快速回答</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-red-800 leading-relaxed">Beijing is <strong>中国的政治文化心脏</strong> — home to the Forbidden City, the Great Wall, and some of the best Peking duck you'll ever eat. It's a city of contrasts where ancient alleyways (hutongs) sit alongside modern skyscrapers. Beijing is also the most convenient entry point for first-time visitors, with two international airports and the largest high-speed rail hub in the country.</p>
    </div>

    <nav class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 mb-12 not-prose">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">🍵 1.茶馆或艺术工作室邀请函</h3>
      <ul class="space-y-3">
        <li><a href="#why-visit" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🏛️ 为什么去北京？</a></li>
        <li><a href="#how-many-days" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">📅 你需要多少天？</a></li>
        <li><a href="#attractions" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🎯 热门景点</a></li>
        <li><a href="#getting-around" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🚇 出行</a></li>
        <li><a href="#where-to-stay" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🏨 住在哪里</a></li>
        <li><a href="#what-to-eat" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🍜 吃什么</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>

    <h2 id="why-visit" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6 mt-12">🏛️ 为什么去北京？</h2>
    <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">北京不仅是一座城市，更是一座活生生的中华文明博物馆。走过紫禁城，你正在追随24位皇帝的脚步。攀登长城，你站在一座有2000多年历史的建筑上。但北京也是一个充满活力的现代化首都，拥有令人难以置信的美食、世界级的博物馆和永不停歇的夜生活。</p>

    <h2 id="how-many-days" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6 mt-12">📅 你需要多少天？</h2>
    <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-4"><strong>最少3天</strong> for the essential Beijing experience.</p>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-lg text-gray-700 mb-6">
      <li><strong>3天（标准）：</strong> Forbidden City + Great Wall + a taste of hutongs and Temple of Heaven</li>
      <li><strong>4-5天（舒适）：</strong> Add the Summer Palace, 798 Art District, and a food tour</li>
      <li><strong>5+天（深潜）：</strong> Day trip to Chengde Mountain Resort or explore the city's lesser-known temples</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 mb-12">仅长城就需要一整天的时间——开车到最近的慕田峪大约需要1.5个小时，所以要相应地计划。</p>

    <h2 id="attractions" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6 mt-12">🎯 热门景点</h2>

    <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-6">
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">紫禁城</h3>
      <p class="text-gray-700">世界上最大的宫殿建筑群，明清王朝的所在地。至少提前一周预订门票——每天的游客人数上限为80000人。周一不营业。</p>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-6">
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">慕田峪长城</h3>
      <p class="text-gray-700">长城保存最完好、对外国人最友好的部分。它有缆车和雪橇——是的，雪橇。距离北京市中心约1.5小时车程。</p>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-6">
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">天坛</h3>
      <p class="text-gray-700">一座令人惊叹的明代寺庙，皇帝曾在这里祈求丰收。清晨参观，看看当地人在周围的公园练习太极和演奏传统乐器。</p>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-6">
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">颐和园</h3>
      <p class="text-gray-700">一座以昆明湖为中心的宏伟皇家园林。非常适合半天的散步，尤其是在春季和秋季，那里的树叶非常壮观。</p>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-12">
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">胡同</h3>
      <p class="text-gray-700">这些狭窄的小巷是北京的传统街区。步行或乘坐人力车探索的最佳地区是南锣鼓巷、五道口和什刹海周边地区。</p>
    </div>

    <h2 id="getting-around" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6 mt-12">🚇 出行</h2>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-3 text-lg text-gray-700 mb-12">
      <li><strong>地铁：</strong> Beijing's metro is extensive, cheap, and has English signs. It covers almost every major attraction. See <a href="/zh/transport/metro-bus/" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">中国主要城市地铁和公交指南</a> for tips on using the Beijing subway system.</li>
      <li><strong>滴滴（中国的优步）：</strong> Super convenient for door-to-door trips. Download the app before you arrive. You can enter destinations in English. Learn how to set it up in <a href="/zh/transport/didi/" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">外国人如何在中国使用滴滴</a>.</li>
      <li><strong>出租车：</strong> Available, but communication can be challenging. Always show your destination in Chinese characters (have your hotel's name written in Chinese).</li>
      <li><strong>骑自行车：</strong> Beijing is surprisingly bikeable. Shared bikes (Hellobike, Meituan) are everywhere. Just use Alipay or WeChat to scan and ride.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 id="where-to-stay" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6 mt-12">🏨 住在哪里</h2>
    <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-6">
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">东城区——最适合首次到访的游客</h3>
      <p class="text-gray-700">中心位置靠近紫禁城、胡同和王府井。价格和便利性的良好平衡。</p>
    </div>
    <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-6">
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">西城区——最适合文化爱好者</h3>
      <p class="text-gray-700">安静、传统的一面。靠近后海湖区，鼓楼和许多保存完好的胡同。</p>
    </div>
    <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-12">
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">朝阳区——最适合商务旅客</h3>
      <p class="text-gray-700">现代CBD。许多国际酒店和西餐厅。靠近798艺术区和三里屯夜生活区。</p>
    </div>

    <h2 id="what-to-eat" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6 mt-12">🍜 吃什么</h2>
    <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">北京的美食是围绕大胆的口味、以小麦为基础的菜肴和皇家烹饪传统而建立的。</p>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-3 text-lg text-gray-700 mb-12">
      <li><strong>北京烤鸭</strong> — Thin, crispy skin wrapped in pancakes with sweet bean sauce, cucumber, and scallions. The definitive Beijing dish.</li>
      <li><strong>Zha Jiang Mian (炸酱面)</strong> — Noodles topped with a thick paste made from fermented soybean paste and minced pork. A humble but beloved local staple.</li>
      <li><strong>煎饼</strong> — A savory crepe filled with egg, crispy wonton, scallions, and chili sauce. The quintessential Beijing street breakfast.</li>
      <li><strong>羊肉火锅/Shuan Yang Rou</strong> — Paper-thin lamb slices cooked in a copper pot of boiling broth. Especially satisfying in winter.</li>
      <li><strong>窦芝</strong> — A fermented mung bean drink that's a true acquired taste. Die-hard local delicacy — tourists may want to just try a sip.</li>
      <li><strong>糖衣山楂</strong> — Candied hawthorn berries on a stick. A classic Beijing street snack.</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="not-prose mt-16">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8">紧急电话号码以及需要帮助时该怎么办</h2>
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <a href="/zh/cities/city-select/" class="block bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 hover:shadow-lg hover:border-blue-300 transition">🗺️ <strong>在中国有多少天？</strong> — Plan your full itinerary</a>
        <a href="/zh/cities/shanghai-guide/" class="block bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 hover:shadow-lg hover:border-blue-300 transition">🌆 <strong>--对外国人最友好的城市</strong> — Compare with China's other great city</a>
        <a href="/zh/transport/transport-guide/" class="block bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 hover:shadow-lg hover:border-blue-300 transition">🚄 <strong>如何环游中国</strong> — All your transport options</a>
        <a href="/zh/transport/high-speed-rail/" class="block bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 hover:shadow-lg hover:border-blue-300 transition">🚄 <strong>如何预订和乘坐中国高铁</strong> — Beijing to Shanghai by train</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>